# Music Factory (temporary name)
## Theme:
- shapez.io clone

## Base idea
- A factory building game centered around being a person compositing a song from notes played by various instruments.

### Classes:
- Object
- Direction
- Player
- Placeable Object
- World
- World Tile
- Music Source
- UI
- Input handler
- Save manager
- Renderer
- Settings manager

No generative AI was used for writing code or creating art assets.
